        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 24.38,
          "end": 24.8,
          "en": "as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 24.8,
          "end": 28.55,
          "en": "So let's say we have a trial like this and we want to delete API.",
