          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 69.02,
          "end": 70.34,
          "en": "So we are not going to delete this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 70.34,
          "end": 76.19,
          "en": "So if we have two strings where they have common prefix, we are just going to delete the characters",
