          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 84.02,
          "end": 87.14,
          "en": "So let's say in this case we want to delete API.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 87.14,
          "end": 91.67,
          "en": "And we can easily see that API is a prefix of API string over here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 91.67,
          "end": 94.64,
          "en": "So after API in the s we have end of string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 94.64,
          "end": 96.8,
